{"id":56693,"date":"2026-08-03T11:42:35","date_gmt":"2026-08-03T10:42:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-4-estacoes-primavera-condeixa\/"},"modified":"2026-08-28T21:22:07","modified_gmt":"2026-08-28T20:22:07","slug":"corrida-4-estacoes-outono-condeixa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-4-estacoes-outono-condeixa\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Outono Condeixa 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre A <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Outono Condeixa 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es Outono Condeixa 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>25 de Outubro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>, na acolhedora vila de <strong>Condeixa-a-Nova<\/strong> (distrito de Coimbra). Integrada no prestigiado circuito desportivo &#8216;Corrida 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es&#8217;, a etapa de Outono oferece um desafio acess\u00edvel no cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico do concelho.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partida agendadas para as <strong>10:00<\/strong> junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Condeixa, o evento disp\u00f5e da Corrida principal de <strong>10 km<\/strong> e de uma Caminhada l\u00fadica de <strong>5 km<\/strong>. Se pretende planear a sua participa\u00e7\u00e3o em eventos de estrada no distrito de Coimbra, pode consultar o nosso direct\u00f3rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-coimbra\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">corridas no distrito de Coimbra<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada com suporte municipal e apoio de cronometragem online, a prova assegura sinaliza\u00e7\u00e3o rigorosa, postos de \u00e1gua aos 5 km e meta, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal personalizado para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es antecipadas e pr\u00e9mios para os v\u00e1rios escal\u00f5es.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snaps